  ('networking-07', 1, 'The 5 GHz band vs 2.4 GHz generally offers…', '["longer range, slower", "shorter range, higher speed/less congestion", "no difference", "more interference"]'::jsonb, 1, '5 GHz: faster, shorter range, less crowded.'),
